(Section 1: General Policy & Equal Opportunity) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 Purpose & Scope) Tj T*
(This document sets forth general company policies governing all employees,) Tj T*
(contractors, and officers across all corporate branches. Acme Enterprises is) Tj T*
(committed to fostering an ethical, transparent, and collaborative environment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2 Equal Employment Opportunity) Tj T*
(Acme provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants) Tj T*
(regardless of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability,) Tj T*
(genetic information, or sexual orientation. Hiring and advancement decisions) Tj T*
(are made solely on merit, qualifications, and business operational needs.) Tj T*
ET
