(ACME ENTERPRISES - CORPORATE POLICY MANUAL) Tj T*
(Section 2: Working Hours & Overtime Guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1 Standard Working Hours) Tj T*
(Standard full-time business hours are 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM local time, Monday) Tj T*
(through Friday. All teams observe Core Collaboration Hours between 10:00 AM) Tj T*
(and 4:00 PM, during which cross-functional meetings and team syncs take place.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.2 Overtime Compensation) Tj T*
(Non-exempt employees who work exceeding 40 hours during an official workweek) Tj T*
(receive overtime pay calculated at 1.5 times their standard hourly rate.) Tj T*
(All non-exempt overtime requires prior approval in writing from the department head.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
