(Section 3: Remote Work & Technology Allowances) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 Hybrid & Remote Work Eligibility) Tj T*
(Eligible team members may work remotely up to two days per week with departmental) Tj T*
(approval. Full-time remote arrangements require executive VP approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 Technology & Home Office Allowance) Tj T*
(Full-time remote employees receive a one-time home office equipment stipend of) Tj T*
($500 upon joining, plus a monthly internet reimbursement subsidy of $50.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
