(ACME ENTERPRISES - CORPORATE POLICY MANUAL) Tj T*
(Section 4: Travel & Business Expense Reimbursement) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.1 Travel Authorization) Tj T*
(All domestic and international corporate travel must be pre-approved via the) Tj T*
(internal travel portal at least 14 days prior to departure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.2 Expense Claims & Per Diem) Tj T*
(Employees receive a per diem rate of $75 for meals while traveling on approved) Tj T*
(business. Itemized receipts are required for all individual expenses exceeding $25.) Tj T*
(Expense reports must be submitted within 30 days of trip conclusion.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
