(Section 5: Information Security & Data Protection) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.1 Password & Access Protocols) Tj T*
(All employees must utilize multi-factor authentication \(MFA\) on corporate accounts.) Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 12 characters in length and rotated every 90 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.2 Confidentiality & Whistleblower Protection) Tj T*
(Proprietary corporate data must never be transmitted via unauthorized third-party) Tj T*
(messaging applications. Employees may report suspected ethical breaches confidentially) Tj T*
(via the dedicated hotline without fear of retaliation.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
