(ACME ENTERPRISES - CORPORATE POLICY MANUAL) Tj T*
(Section 6: Comprehensive Leave Policy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.1 Annual Leave \(Paid Time Off\)) Tj T*
(Full-time personnel receive 20 days of paid annual vacation leave per calendar year,) Tj T*
(accrued on a monthly pro-rata basis. A maximum of 5 unused days may roll over to the next year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.2 Sick Leave) Tj T*
(Employees are entitled to 10 paid sick leave days per calendar year. For sick leave) Tj T*
(exceeding 3 consecutive business days, a certified medical practitioner note is mandatory.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.3 Parental Leave) Tj T*
(Primary caregivers are entitled to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave following) Tj T*
(the birth, adoption, or foster placement of a child. Secondary caregivers receive 4 weeks paid leave.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.4 Bereavement Leave) Tj T*
(Employees are provided up to 5 consecutive paid business days for immediate family members) Tj T*
(and up to 3 days for extended family members.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
